    "language": "en",
    "text": "Rajesh \"Raj\" Subramaniam (born September 14, 1967) is an Indian-American business executive who is the chief executive officer and president of the FedEx Corporation. Prior to this position, he held many organizational management and marketing roles in Asia and the United States at FedEx.\n\n",
